==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|LL.|en}}; short for {{m|en|membrana conjunctiva}}. From 1540s.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|conjunctivae}}

# {{label|en|anatomy}} A clear [[mucous membrane]] that lines the inner surface of the [[eyelid]] and the exposed surface of the [[eyeball]] or [[sclera]].

